      <p class="text-gray-300">VPSDime is one of the few remaining independent VPS providers that owns its hardware and operates its own ASN. Founded in 2011 and run by a small team under Winity LLC, the company has built a following among developers who need disproportionate RAM and vCPU per dollar — entry-level plans pack 12 GB RAM for $6/mo, which is roughly 3x the RAM of comparable budget competitors. The trade-off is a no-frills experience: no managed support tiers, no flashy dashboard, just KVM root access on enterprise hardware.</p>
